  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "倘若只有学者才能读书，那我也就不再说什么了。",
      "output_sha256": "827874fe540aaf91ef35ef9322388496744a2cff1a0e4e5c5590d2555cb87057",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.466368,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "83d7c30d7d9c0c5ae0606bb4b52083badee99479b798696e578285194340d30d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "827874fe540aaf91ef35ef9322388496744a2cff1a0e4e5c5590d2555cb87057",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "大概书不是专为学者预备的；那么，我可要多嘴了。",
      "output_sha256": "d1a42e29c8be97819c7a970e0dfe7fbb9c071c188643305657991da11000480f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "d1a42e29c8be97819c7a970e0dfe7fbb9c071c188643305657991da11000480f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "从我一生下来直到如今，没人盼望我成个学者；我永远喜欢服从多数人的意见。",
      "output_sha256": "2c566edadbf190554f3e4cb1be888da1cb7336ad14a20a32fefa457865021742",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "2c566edadbf190554f3e4cb1be888da1cb7336ad14a20a32fefa457865021742",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而，我却热爱阅读。",
      "output_sha256": "6f12b0741fadb3bc23b6267410be57c87be67b19196a969a34549e4b35a88766",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": 0.303571,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5ef4387b5d0c09ee54ebb49247fb59e39100674d681cc4da8d9769d8a52151f0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6f12b0741fadb3bc23b6267410be57c87be67b19196a969a34549e4b35a88766",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "书籍的种类繁多，能够与我产生共鸣的却屈指可数。",
      "output_sha256": "88a928bddf697dbd2c385e4a0cfe51d7b3c9e4909b3f5719d1f01ebeadceafcf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.424425,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a16094419e7d09cffbc6c8d0707286de12b062132591fb8ac77e3f6ea1af7eeb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "88a928bddf697dbd2c385e4a0cfe51d7b3c9e4909b3f5719d1f01ebeadceafcf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我有决定念什么的全权；自幼儿我就会逃学，楞挨板子也不肯说我爱《三字经》和《百家姓》。",
      "output_sha256": "874d5e7ca1805610bf46406bb4d54323dd9a7ee4ad8bcb97c133bca2230a4d00",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "874d5e7ca1805610bf46406bb4d54323dd9a7ee4ad8bcb97c133bca2230a4d00",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "对，《三字经》便可以代表一类——这类书，据我看，顶好在判了无期徒刑以后去念，反正活着也没多大味儿。",
      "output_sha256": "f8e0733ab537461ed58f5c2199de2378d1482ee6ab481c2b2b716875730c3d49",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "f8e0733ab537461ed58f5c2199de2378d1482ee6ab481c2b2b716875730c3d49",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这类书可真不少，不知道为什么；也许是犯无期徒刑罪的太多；要不然便是太少——我自己就常想杀些写这类书的人。",
      "output_sha256": "fdceaf6281c1eadb7c3663ed598c4b615659334a38c9600a3c2d8698dacd041e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "fdceaf6281c1eadb7c3663ed598c4b615659334a38c9600a3c2d8698dacd041e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "可我至今未曾下手，首先是因为我渐渐意识到，写这种书的人中，恐怕有不少早已去世，比如那位写《尚书》的李二哥。",
      "output_sha256": "23464cb926d808ae751392b4e0c25111393fbd196de595415a02a5f475a38074",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.477803,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "90a50c9fb4dc845d5c746b8e0006e705cbc5a20b73af5db52f68d0ff2b4ac507"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "23464cb926d808ae751392b4e0c25111393fbd196de595415a02a5f475a38074",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "其次是因为时下仍有些人偏爱这类书，我不想得罪太多人。",
      "output_sha256": "a52798020fa2f7298c9cd5fc2dac21892d0937897600ab1703ec19472d4e2c54",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.576563,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "eaeeeb190560da8856cb5e3b0b4586cb71bc5d5e1c9042434e16262f3b782d59"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a52798020fa2f7298c9cd5fc2dac21892d0937897600ab1703ec19472d4e2c54",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "总之，我认为不必理会别人；不喜欢的书就不去碰了。",
      "output_sha256": "61094f07c18e35621e20d2bf35bb0e0239fc6c6497a192b90e78b54603e3969b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.425119,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e66da6a0213055dc7a08738a244e8da4cd3a3fd80e29a3dcc60af259bc104afc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "61094f07c18e35621e20d2bf35bb0e0239fc6c6497a192b90e78b54603e3969b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "好在，我爸爸没希望我成个学者。",
      "output_sha256": "a658ab224d0c450882b262129c936b948b5587b98a6012307a346534a6581f60",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "a658ab224d0c450882b262129c936b948b5587b98a6012307a346534a6581f60",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "第二类书籍与我无缘：满是公式，连“然而”和“所以”都没有。",
      "output_sha256": "ba1948f808ad6d10fadc2a7e1d35dee571b16648c36e700d236ef59f983679cc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.633877,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8482c30c45207168375c03587d81b4f7fa1d1a518a87ecb8ed7637d5675c3a63"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ba1948f808ad6d10fadc2a7e1d35dee571b16648c36e700d236ef59f983679cc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "据说，这类书里藏着打开宇宙秘密的小金钥匙。",
      "output_sha256": "742b40900be62776d045c5a18942a56f1b7224627bf53db066b02dab5686069c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "742b40900be62776d045c5a18942a56f1b7224627bf53db066b02dab5686069c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我倒久想明白点真理，如地是圆的之类；可是这种书别扭，它老瞪着我。",
      "output_sha256": "a8b20af9da28cd965e6cc954c86331045b41a9758f9c57890ad9599305bbc7ab",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "a8b20af9da28cd965e6cc954c86331045b41a9758f9c57890ad9599305bbc7ab",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "书不老老实实的当本书，瞪人干吗呀？",
      "output_sha256": "9b7afde7f33428d16e2b1280e13b082d24c8ed16eea1b2ed75d9450735011e26",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "9b7afde7f33428d16e2b1280e13b082d24c8ed16eea1b2ed75d9450735011e26",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我实在受不了这种气！",
      "output_sha256": "de3628eeca25f3f22038c21449fcf685591c885459c7c41aa88d0bcd7a99a08d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.405556,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "19b8cdac4ba10944aaa0eff6d20f96385139fb1dd8d1ea7831369ba78294eab5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "de3628eeca25f3f22038c21449fcf685591c885459c7c41aa88d0bcd7a99a08d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有一回，一位朋友给我一本《相对论原理》，他说：明白这个就什么都明白了。",
      "output_sha256": "59885d626982753259b11cfceca5b00140156078751967ab403b2c9e63d0fe91",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "59885d626982753259b11cfceca5b00140156078751967ab403b2c9e63d0fe91",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我下了决心去念这本宝贝书。",
      "output_sha256": "258b326345587500dc8b5381a3b82498c5d1fd4176811979ec746f9d2e9dd217",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "258b326345587500dc8b5381a3b82498c5d1fd4176811979ec746f9d2e9dd217",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "读了两个“配纸”，我遇上了一个公式。",
      "output_sha256": "6f01543594d19f59b1c5654f609f9258170702b66c72ca6c4a17d809d6f8ea71",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "6f01543594d19f59b1c5654f609f9258170702b66c72ca6c4a17d809d6f8ea71",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我跟它“相对”了两点多钟！",
      "output_sha256": "12ee1919cd6da40c7f16e24767e574ad2db3017a5bef606548fa68e6169c17f8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "12ee1919cd6da40c7f16e24767e574ad2db3017a5bef606548fa68e6169c17f8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "往后边一看，公式还多了去啦！",
      "output_sha256": "e5efb0d06e602c2bba27d784649cc02a4745465b0452ebab2c0a94e5d7451a33",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "e5efb0d06e602c2bba27d784649cc02a4745465b0452ebab2c0a94e5d7451a33",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我知道和它们“相对”下去，它们也许不在乎，我还活着不呢？",
      "output_sha256": "b528b58ace331a27832abbe93ffa4d978d878361a62f067e9ff17e3974b16687",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "b528b58ace331a27832abbe93ffa4d978d878361a62f067e9ff17e3974b16687",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "不过，我对这类书还是有些敬畏的。",
      "output_sha256": "d126ad06c1710b29f33f25e43b4f0fe045c289378924324804dcfe7cf5afd604",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.498736,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3233e07f0fcb3b119fa51a2f6fef0ee3310df3a2f6072c3efce1222fd36dd26d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d126ad06c1710b29f33f25e43b4f0fe045c289378924324804dcfe7cf5afd604",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这类书和第一类有些不同，我看得出。",
      "output_sha256": "20e278a4cc654aba864eef8530615eeaf21c1871f29ddf60e76e9e5d17e6eb1c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "20e278a4cc654aba864eef8530615eeaf21c1871f29ddf60e76e9e5d17e6eb1c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "第一类书不是没法懂，而是懂了以后使我更糊涂。",
      "output_sha256": "b68b26988567b6f3cf4ab0884f1a4848063e56d434c14c4aa3e9608892c97dc6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "b68b26988567b6f3cf4ab0884f1a4848063e56d434c14c4aa3e9608892c97dc6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "以我现在的理解力——比上我七岁的时候，我现在满可以作圣人了——我能明白“人之初，性本善”。",
      "output_sha256": "821942e961290a31ef0b619b58ee95df96b79c1d4caed5a879ab527c557b7d0c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "821942e961290a31ef0b619b58ee95df96b79c1d4caed5a879ab527c557b7d0c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "明白完了，紧跟着就糊涂了；昨儿个晚上，我还挨了小女儿——玫瑰唇的小天使——一个嘴巴。",
      "output_sha256": "779b89a1005e7f76a4b6220bf01daaadfb066a11025463eec87e648b2b7b2c56",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "779b89a1005e7f76a4b6220bf01daaadfb066a11025463eec87e648b2b7b2c56",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我知道这个小天使的本性并不善良，她才两岁。",
      "output_sha256": "e66d7e6064cae126286316daeca779a46189dce6390796a3143b041682a72ac9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.729135,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e192977e7f773942108bf3819498e1b2b7f7e3a722606c0d4312585dfd7e9b89"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e66d7e6064cae126286316daeca779a46189dce6390796a3143b041682a72ac9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "第二类书根本无法理解，但人家的纸上没有一句废话；懂不懂的，人家不搞玄虚，它只是盯着我，或者我该盯着它。",
      "output_sha256": "220115c4ccb04a24983c42a9cb8248dbf9a6aaf471474209260d1f9ff76e5139",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.657294,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2c764688b5a54e52c399bd2f49e871c014dee2770af55f981cfbd66ff3240928"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "220115c4ccb04a24983c42a9cb8248dbf9a6aaf471474209260d1f9ff76e5139",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我的心这么一软，便把它好好放在书架上；好打好散，别太伤了和气。",
      "output_sha256": "de1de67615d2ead1d1904b3d002c55cbf9724ce727d13a2343f2c5850734b475",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "de1de67615d2ead1d1904b3d002c55cbf9724ce727d13a2343f2c5850734b475",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这要说到第三类书了。",
      "output_sha256": "31c1df4c19a5e97ab677aa6f7cac9daa01da6225cd3f571a1a13955c9c143618",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "31c1df4c19a5e97ab677aa6f7cac9daa01da6225cd3f571a1a13955c9c143618",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "其实这不该算作一类；就姑且这么算吧。",
      "output_sha256": "07ff92bf7ceafb32effc2d4daca250c7f5489a7401e7258235f131f0f7d8ffd3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.747814,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5bc692e36ab65bb124ba25de8f49ec2a26b0d4da509d783376413493a0780d8e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "07ff92bf7ceafb32effc2d4daca250c7f5489a7401e7258235f131f0f7d8ffd3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这类书是这样的：名气挺大，念过的人总不肯说它坏，没念过的人老怪害羞的说将要念。",
      "output_sha256": "7c37f1403218cf61cf939d3dd1662c462930d8c1e606719e4ac90511d12d0b84",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "7c37f1403218cf61cf939d3dd1662c462930d8c1e606719e4ac90511d12d0b84",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "比如《元曲》，太炎“先生”的文章，罗马悲剧，辛克莱的小说，《大公报》——不知是哪里出版的书——都算在这一类。",
      "output_sha256": "9ddb4d7358b3900b45bc2a2d8deb5a9e0c351033c5bee79f51391a0fc46c58f1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.679649,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0a73963b50caae5a09a5e82dc35cf59f390d4882925c0595ff4b03ef6cd96b19"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9ddb4d7358b3900b45bc2a2d8deb5a9e0c351033c5bee79f51391a0fc46c58f1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        35,
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "对此，我也曾翻阅，随手又放下。",
      "output_sha256": "3e25a4fc37a13eb1f0f80bc7ae2d404bb0eee4a371064b6408b6ce0dbfb8d5df",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.679649,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0a73963b50caae5a09a5e82dc35cf59f390d4882925c0595ff4b03ef6cd96b19"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3e25a4fc37a13eb1f0f80bc7ae2d404bb0eee4a371064b6408b6ce0dbfb8d5df",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        35,
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这里还就属那本《大公报》有点劲。",
      "output_sha256": "ea36a1d8e22cebbc183469ea960c49892846bca9fe5bb54f1e6988441bc2352d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "ea36a1d8e22cebbc183469ea960c49892846bca9fe5bb54f1e6988441bc2352d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我不害羞，永远不说将要念。",
      "output_sha256": "d27ba2f5011944e07921ddf670491a7bc1e512aa758ac24aac17c7cc233b5ee6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "d27ba2f5011944e07921ddf670491a7bc1e512aa758ac24aac17c7cc233b5ee6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "许多书籍的广告和名声都很响亮，我只能承认广告做得不错，至于威风如何，谁在乎呢。",
      "output_sha256": "cfee40c8390e59a1b3c06f07ce5527bc75303b19858ac3f0c9da410e1570522b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": 0.505519,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        38
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "36bfc8a4b1ecd67d17c36fee68ccf48f5cf9693a72bf6f8d629d7232291f6e8f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cfee40c8390e59a1b3c06f07ce5527bc75303b19858ac3f0c9da410e1570522b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“类”还多着呢，不便再说；有上面的三项也就足以证明我怎样的不高明了。",
      "output_sha256": "12469ebe2f2b601b7f807d932418e00a01462df9bbe00850f1953889f273fb58",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "12469ebe2f2b601b7f807d932418e00a01462df9bbe00850f1953889f273fb58",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "该说读的方法。",
      "output_sha256": "f0c906002fcd696fc3402c83b99e44cff6e509f3dac8a3ac557ea0fba05b50c8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "f0c906002fcd696fc3402c83b99e44cff6e509f3dac8a3ac557ea0fba05b50c8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在我看来，如何读书是个自我决定的问题；我说我的，没强迫任何人跟我学习。",
      "output_sha256": "c5d7afcdf2e2d5a50a47e1e5597f725cf6c9271660827fe698e2fc9e897e0e16",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.56129,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "09002c9dc019eeb6885792af0f4fcd6c11b13c01d7d9ae301e2583388beb2045"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c5d7afcdf2e2d5a50a47e1e5597f725cf6c9271660827fe698e2fc9e897e0e16",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "第一，我读书没系统。",
      "output_sha256": "49dd9031de88b8f480e3ebbc68c21c6e2bebb8a35a3dd462f97a0c4dd6a65957",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "49dd9031de88b8f480e3ebbc68c21c6e2bebb8a35a3dd462f97a0c4dd6a65957",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "借什么、买什么、遇到什么，就读什么。",
      "output_sha256": "5f456e1cce6fbd956356ad68e0f0c4006661b3a180a6041b8f9f51e098fe6b67",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.718571,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e65043835a40eebe3d05b31ed0ecb2a49a2f54781d051ab4b9ec148d2378b9c0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5f456e1cce6fbd956356ad68e0f0c4006661b3a180a6041b8f9f51e098fe6b67",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不懂的放下，使我糊涂的放下，没趣味的放下，不客气。",
      "output_sha256": "df4d889cec0ce95c64aebc45a4b3bb1ad2e4e74ef076622dc5a31baef5783b81",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "df4d889cec0ce95c64aebc45a4b3bb1ad2e4e74ef076622dc5a31baef5783b81",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我不能叫书管着我。",
      "output_sha256": "97c58070e4ca104b3eb9bbf4c3da58be4be85fe5d30e9d7ad3540de3b1d6b101",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "97c58070e4ca104b3eb9bbf4c3da58be4be85fe5d30e9d7ad3540de3b1d6b101",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "其次，我读得很快，却不记得内容。",
      "output_sha256": "3a941e8328a4899d1a6684f55018f894160f2cc2cb964891cd6ef1b54c39a691",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.484217,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4ece6b8b0887b105082a40d1b0ee7901bef735aa9745778e139a985c77d39eab"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3a941e8328a4899d1a6684f55018f894160f2cc2cb964891cd6ef1b54c39a691",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "书要都叫我记住，还要书干吗？",
      "output_sha256": "50783179dc7254ee3a4e6520f8aaa90240b32bd6e27aab6fa2de7f3f23fa000a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "50783179dc7254ee3a4e6520f8aaa90240b32bd6e27aab6fa2de7f3f23fa000a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "书应该记住自己。",
      "output_sha256": "64c0005552d8c024f2f192220d7d91467ea96dfd807a511763251a7f1415a27e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "64c0005552d8c024f2f192220d7d91467ea96dfd807a511763251a7f1415a27e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "对我，最讨厌的发问是：“那个典故是哪儿的呢？”",
      "output_sha256": "e74d831b2b1a04cb92d17b1ef073ad05f5aa504c1426d58c8400a96fc23423ea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "e74d831b2b1a04cb92d17b1ef073ad05f5aa504c1426d58c8400a96fc23423ea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“那句书是怎么来着？”",
      "output_sha256": "c8f9773d4abf810054df4dca5bd2f86cfd8475e39fc81fd0dc8c8c779b3849e7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "c8f9773d4abf810054df4dca5bd2f86cfd8475e39fc81fd0dc8c8c779b3849e7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我永不回答这样的考问，即使我记得。",
      "output_sha256": "43d3f453ae7dc53ef173a3b29a40262de243ffcaa46d3bfd3f35e39e0c7091b3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "43d3f453ae7dc53ef173a3b29a40262de243ffcaa46d3bfd3f35e39e0c7091b3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我又不是印刷器养的，管你这一套！",
      "output_sha256": "73f1fdf2ec9c113059bfeeea8a2666858acf0bf34f18b06878be8fc66e049a83",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "73f1fdf2ec9c113059bfeeea8a2666858acf0bf34f18b06878be8fc66e049a83",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "读得快，因为我有时候跳过几页去。",
      "output_sha256": "40c9cfc677f6aecda0abf3f6bb326ef531d2bceb428b0a69ebeac5fd9ace82fe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "40c9cfc677f6aecda0abf3f6bb326ef531d2bceb428b0a69ebeac5fd9ace82fe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不合我的意，我就练习跳远。",
      "output_sha256": "a01e59c5bcf5ba8ab7d53e180b92da29fed441d83da38ccb7cbf6fc7d5b6386d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "a01e59c5bcf5ba8ab7d53e180b92da29fed441d83da38ccb7cbf6fc7d5b6386d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "书要是不服气的话，来跳我呀！",
      "output_sha256": "fda38008213c546123aaa8e26defbed9f871e39e8c61a94e66e8b363b69dfca1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "fda38008213c546123aaa8e26defbed9f871e39e8c61a94e66e8b363b69dfca1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "看侦探小说时，我总是先翻到最后几页，省事。",
      "output_sha256": "870f84806fa8d83fd6037eba2f8a6bc528f26ea504ed9d7f22817c5d08262b81",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": 0.667308,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6683b0b843d29793d0d1ee456cb2c814cc0a0f294aa788e68dabd1f62fe5d06f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_ai_sha256": "870f84806fa8d83fd6037eba2f8a6bc528f26ea504ed9d7f22817c5d08262b81",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "最后，读完一本书，从不发表批评，谁也不告诉。",
      "output_sha256": "8d17e8fdfe7b6b39e8f26ac23f6f02b5d98d2d581cf06157b886d7fa09f9346a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": 0.656788,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cd23242dfcaeccd78b25a56d09fab3bad6c629b3103913cf7097cd1520b88753"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8d17e8fdfe7b6b39e8f26ac23f6f02b5d98d2d581cf06157b886d7fa09f9346a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        58
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "一旦告诉就麻烦：“嘿，你读过《啼笑因缘》吗？”",
      "output_sha256": "f852aa461bf26f110152ad48fcbcec59bd0b669c8eee3584cdcab8b8fe2fc660",
      "alignment_unit_index": 58,
      "alignment_score": 0.639098,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        58
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6e793d43002d83ab2328ecb0ab3fbcf82d1be33443666389f4aa5fc3618f4efd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f852aa461bf26f110152ad48fcbcec59bd0b669c8eee3584cdcab8b8fe2fc660",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        59
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "要大家都不读《啼笑因缘》，人家写它干吗呢？",
      "output_sha256": "85d17bae5e9e081b03d78bcabe772465381444fa1c1338b3f98f98108c43fc76",
      "alignment_unit_index": 59,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "85d17bae5e9e081b03d78bcabe772465381444fa1c1338b3f98f98108c43fc76",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "一旦批评就糟：“您这点意见？”",
      "output_sha256": "86b27057b3580a11410e00748415074f0f7944480188a987e3202b8861949646",
      "alignment_unit_index": 60,
      "alignment_score": 0.721753,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        60
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6c4a4a3acbd4ada0bc5267594c83fe94584618b344559df6c19955b388feeb51"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_ai_sha256": "86b27057b3580a11410e00748415074f0f7944480188a987e3202b8861949646",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        61
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我不惹气。",
      "output_sha256": "cdd34fe2d5acc09003fdded5c822d776278ed5ffb25f164bb016b9394f4e566a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 61,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_human_sha256": "cdd34fe2d5acc09003fdded5c822d776278ed5ffb25f164bb016b9394f4e566a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "读完一本书再打通儿架，不上算。",
      "output_sha256": "c4c656db89cea0fa831c532ddbf92c00cf261f931d7eb17b8520b03e0df050d1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 62,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_human_sha256": "c4c656db89cea0fa831c532ddbf92c00cf261f931d7eb17b8520b03e0df050d1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 64,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我有我的爱与不爱，存在我自己心里。",
      "output_sha256": "520e35e3f5b14afc4f29ff717ec996f63c1affdffe389b5e1a9882712a34f3c6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 63,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 63,
      "source_human_sha256": "520e35e3f5b14afc4f29ff717ec996f63c1affdffe389b5e1a9882712a34f3c6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 65,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "喜欢的书就读，不论我的感受是否显得自私。",
      "output_sha256": "641b614768e61fe76aaff0f8c44c488f9db938981203589104e8e9f85dd59489",
      "alignment_unit_index": 64,
      "alignment_score": 0.278929,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        64
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9de181b4047045d0642430e2105570ae383bf6eaea1b96d8b81dc46c47dd6c2c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 65,
      "source_ai_sha256": "641b614768e61fe76aaff0f8c44c488f9db938981203589104e8e9f85dd59489",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        65
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 66,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "再说呢，我读书似乎只要求一点灵感。",
      "output_sha256": "78d1b94fbee56bab654ffb61c8589ba558e691fa44e100a8411411ac0c01121d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 65,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 65,
      "source_human_sha256": "78d1b94fbee56bab654ffb61c8589ba558e691fa44e100a8411411ac0c01121d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 67,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“印象甚佳”便是好书，我没工夫去细细分析它，所以根本便不能批评。",
      "output_sha256": "508ee2bc5e252603277c5aa0901a0aa80c43234f1f9bed903d15deb66bdbb72c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 66,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 66,
      "source_human_sha256": "508ee2bc5e252603277c5aa0901a0aa80c43234f1f9bed903d15deb66bdbb72c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 68,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“印象甚佳”有时候并不是全书的，而是书中的一段最入我的味；因为这一段使我对这全书有了好感；其实这一段的美或者正足以破坏了全体的美，但是我不去管；有一段叫我喜欢两天的，我就感谢不尽。",
      "output_sha256": "0d02c85aaf576c699fd6d78ca549caaadef3de1497bae4335cfde3f05334b0ee",
      "alignment_unit_index": 67,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 67,
      "source_human_sha256": "0d02c85aaf576c699fd6d78ca549caaadef3de1497bae4335cfde3f05334b0ee",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 69,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "因此，设若我真去批评，大概是高明不了。",
      "output_sha256": "b1a244569bce8f404165ec14414d5fc07de5a2504098c42933c1512e5f8d5a83",
      "alignment_unit_index": 68,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 68,
      "source_human_sha256": "b1a244569bce8f404165ec14414d5fc07de5a2504098c42933c1512e5f8d5a83",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 70,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "第四，我不读自己的书，不愿谈论自己的书。",
      "output_sha256": "b302c82e0dbb7a2e0869e0e27046d00bcc951cb1fd7382a092d3d6e944a22ec9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 69,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 69,
      "source_human_sha256": "b302c82e0dbb7a2e0869e0e27046d00bcc951cb1fd7382a092d3d6e944a22ec9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 71,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“儿子是自己的好”，我还不清楚，因为我还没有儿子。",
      "output_sha256": "639850e1450148884ec3e16375f184f65a0b8010f4ec40f1669f2ba2246fc820",
      "alignment_unit_index": 70,
      "alignment_score": 0.721104,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        70
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8753fce077970c91b0c7645fc43d3de59544dc2887b6c1543e2c83a95ce4de3e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 71,
      "source_ai_sha256": "639850e1450148884ec3e16375f184f65a0b8010f4ec40f1669f2ba2246fc820",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        71
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 72,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "有个小女儿，女儿是否能代表儿子，尚无定论。",
      "output_sha256": "a75ef75f6d7316931da6c3f1d61418353795e323bde79ef302ab70f7b8da2716",
      "alignment_unit_index": 71,
      "alignment_score": 0.618866,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        71
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ab313c6412653a85349f9d805a60a91db3e4ac02fe3a5c9ae6810c67a4c99e9e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 72,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a75ef75f6d7316931da6c3f1d61418353795e323bde79ef302ab70f7b8da2716",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        72
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 73,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“老婆是别人的好”，我也不敢支持，尤其是在家里。",
      "output_sha256": "5181ead43f072126faa2abb328ccbe4d6ea6268486246b44e6fb6a127be59ee4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 72,
      "alignment_score": 0.699452,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        72
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1d71f151b3248de484a8e593e8e3d2da889c008eaa2f6a29b7093ad9597498f7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 73,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5181ead43f072126faa2abb328ccbe4d6ea6268486246b44e6fb6a127be59ee4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        73
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 74,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但是我准知道，书是别人的好。",
      "output_sha256": "364dca4a1d81510ca1139a0cbf4703ef3cbff0c38b60f4aca17c28d914921ac6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 73,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 73,
      "source_human_sha256": "364dca4a1d81510ca1139a0cbf4703ef3cbff0c38b60f4aca17c28d914921ac6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 75,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "别人的书自然未必都好，可是至少给我一点我不知道的东西。",
      "output_sha256": "d4907f60a22ba18ea25090321ad049871556988422bc63621b8977cee51572cb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 74,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 74,
      "source_human_sha256": "d4907f60a22ba18ea25090321ad049871556988422bc63621b8977cee51572cb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 76,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "自己的，一提都头疼！",
      "output_sha256": "c8c20c16465ac52cfd9b6912c83932d4513aef39019cd7aa89eac7a0e5aad643",
      "alignment_unit_index": 75,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 75,
      "source_human_sha256": "c8c20c16465ac52cfd9b6912c83932d4513aef39019cd7aa89eac7a0e5aad643",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 77,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "自己的书，和自己的运气，好像永远是一对儿累赘。",
      "output_sha256": "51ca9b30e1edfa89b91151a749bea39aee079d7f7e561264949785a80c278e72",
      "alignment_unit_index": 76,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 76,
      "source_human_sha256": "51ca9b30e1edfa89b91151a749bea39aee079d7f7e561264949785a80c278e72",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 78,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "第五，哼，算了吧。",
      "output_sha256": "00feb83faca5d877106c68afb39bab1f64e32ca90a24405d11878a0065b7cc59",
      "alignment_unit_index": 77,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 77,
      "source_human_sha256": "00feb83faca5d877106c68afb39bab1f64e32ca90a24405d11878a0065b7cc59",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
